# textdomain: just_coords

A configurable HUD that displays the player's position, direction, and biome in multiple modes, colors, sizes, and positions.=A configurable HUD that displays the player's position, direction, and biome in multiple modes, colors, sizes, and positions.

North=North
East=East
South=South
West=West

Loading...=Loading...

List of the just_coords commands:=List of the just_coords commands:
/coords  → Show this list=/coords  → Show this list
/coords-mode1 → Hide coordinates=/coords-mode1 → Hide coordinates
/coords-mode2 → Show Position only=/coords-mode2 → Show Position only
/coords-mode3 → Show Position + Direction=/coords-mode3 → Show Position + Direction
/coords-mode4 → Show Position + Direction + Biome=/coords-mode4 → Show Position + Direction + Biome
/coords-cyan → Set color to Cyan=/coords-cyan → Set color to Cyan
/coords-magenta → Set color to Magenta=/coords-magenta → Set color to Magenta
/coords-red → Set color to Red=/coords-red → Set color to Red
/coords-white → Set color to White=/coords-white → Set color to White
/coords-yellow → Set color to Yellow=/coords-yellow → Set color to Yellow
/coords-normal → Set font size to Normal=/coords-normal → Set font size to Normal
/coords-big → Set font size to Big=/coords-big → Set font size to Big
/coords-biggest → Set font size to Biggest=/coords-biggest → Set font size to Biggest
/coords-top → Set display position to Top=/coords-top → Set display position to Top
/coords-middle → Set display position to Middle=/coords-middle → Set display position to Middle
/coords-bottom → Set display position to Bottom=/coords-bottom → Set display position to Bottom

